{"path":"draft_response","owner":"identity_access","channel":"reply_to_requester","recipient":"Oliver Grant","message":"Hi Oliver,

You can reset your password directly from the login screen. Click **Forgot password**, verify your identity using your registered mobile number, and then set a new password (minimum 14 characters).  

Since the account is locked, it will automatically unlock after 15 minutes if you prefer to wait. If you don’t have a registered mobile number, just let me know and I’ll have the Identity & Access team call you to complete the reset."}

{"path":"draft_response","owner":"business_applications","channel":"reply_to_requester","recipient":"Henrik Olsen","message":"Hi Henrik,

The timeout you’re seeing is due to the size of the month‑end stock valuation export (over 100,000 rows). Please run the report using the **“Execute in background”** option. The export will be processed in the background, and you can retrieve the completed file from the spool list the next morning.

Let me know if you need any assistance locating the spool list or scheduling the background run."}

{"path":"draft_response","owner":"network_infrastructure","channel":"reply_to_requester","recipient":"Marion Delacroix (Reception, Head Office)","message":"Hi Marion,

For a visit longer than one day you’ll need a multi‑day guest Wi‑Fi voucher. Please submit a request on the service portal under **Network > Guest access** and specify the auditor’s name and the two‑day period. Once the request is approved, the voucher will be generated and can be given to the guest.

Let me know if you need any further assistance."}
